\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">I'm off to find a robin.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a7/I%27m_off_to_find_a_robin..png/revision/latest?cb=20231103161954\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"I&#39;m off to find a robin.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a7/I%27m_off_to_find_a_robin..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20231103161954\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a7/I%27m_off_to_find_a_robin..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20231103161954 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a7/I%27m_off_to_find_a_robin..png/revision/latest?cb=20231103161954 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"I&#39;m off to find a robin.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"I%27m_off_to_find_a_robin..png\" data-image-name=\"I&#39;m off to find a robin..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_16\" title=\"Series 16\">16</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lucy_Beaumont\" title=\"Lucy Beaumont\">Lucy Beaumont</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brother_Alex.\" title=\"Brother Alex.\">Brother Alex.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Never_packed_a_boot.\" title=\"Never packed a boot.\">Never packed a boot.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>I'm off to find a robin.</b></i> is the seventh episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_16\" title=\"Series 16\">Series 16</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 2 November 2023. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Lucy_Beaumont\" title=\"Lucy Beaumont\">Lucy Beaumont</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I%27m_off_to_find_a_robin.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"I'm off to find a robin\" is uttered by <a href=\"/wiki/Julian_Clary\" title=\"Julian Clary\">Julian Clary</a> at the end of the <a href=\"/wiki/Put_yourself_somewhere_within_the_boundary\" title=\"Put yourself somewhere within the boundary\">Put yourself somewhere within the boundary</a> task, after Julian – who has been impersonating <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> – remembers that Alex likes bird-watching. The title card is of the <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Best_Greg_Davies_merchandise_that_isn%27t_on_the_market_but_should_be_on_the_market\" title=\"Best Greg Davies merchandise that isn&#39;t on the market but should be on the market\">puppet</a> pulling a switch, in a box that says 'DON'T' on it. This is the same switch used in the <a href=\"/wiki/Do_whatever_you_like_with_these_switches\" title=\"Do whatever you like with these switches\">Do whatever you like with these switches</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I%27m_off_to_find_a_robin.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Tutka päällä', which translates as 'Radar on'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Jag drar för att hitta en Robin', which translates as 'I'm off to find a Robin'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I%27m_off_to_find_a_robin.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Julian_Clary\" title=\"Julian Clary\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Julian Clary</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lucy_Beaumont\" title=\"Lucy Beaumont\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lucy Beaumont</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sam_Campbell\" title=\"Sam Campbell\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sam Campbell</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sue_Perkins\" title=\"Sue Perkins\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sue Perkins</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Susan_Wokoma\" title=\"Susan Wokoma\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Susan Wokoma</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_thing_that_is_most_guaranteed_to_make_you_groan\" title=\"The thing that is most guaranteed to make you groan\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The thing that is most guaranteed to make you groan.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Do_whatever_you_like_with_these_switches\" title=\"Do whatever you like with these switches\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Do whatever you like with these switches for five minutes. You will then do a task in the lab for five minutes. The conditions in the lab will change according to when you switch the switches in here.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">DQ\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">DQ\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">DQ\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Balance the most tees on the shelves. You must stay on the platform throughout the task.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pie_Wayne_in_the_face\" title=\"Pie Wayne in the face\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Pie Wayne in the face. Wayne is outside the front door. You may not touch Wayne nor step on the red green. If you miss Wayne with the pie, you must copy Wayne's dance moves for 10 seconds.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Put_yourself_somewhere_within_the_boundary\" title=\"Put yourself somewhere within the boundary\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Put yourself somewhere within the boundary. The person furthest from everyone else wins. The people closest together both lose two points. Also, throughout the task, you must behave really weirdly.\n</td>\n<td>1<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ScoresS16E7&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ScoresS16E7-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ScoresS16E7&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ScoresS16E7-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Catch_three_balls_on_your_head\" title=\"Catch three balls on your head\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Catch three balls on your head. After you've caught a ball, you must shout \"ball\". You may not step off your circles, move your circles, adjust your arms or touch the balls with your hands.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_the_contents_of_your_party_popper_furthest\" title=\"Fire the contents of your party popper furthest\">T</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> From your seated position, fire the contents of your party popper furthest.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td><b>✔</b>\n</td>\n<td>✘\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">14\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>6\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Notes</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"references-small\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-ScoresS16E7-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-ScoresS16E7_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-ScoresS16E7_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Julian and Sue placed third and fourth respectively in this task, but as they were the two closest people, their scores were lowered from 3 and 2 to 1 and 0.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/I%27m_off_to_find_a_robin.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/im-find-robin\"><i>I'm off to find a robin.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/\"><i>I'm off to find a robin.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141524\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.088 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.140 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 871/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25892/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 170/2097152 bytes\nHighest